  "scope": "Quint controls for one span-storage handoff, one storage-handoff receipt, one stream-release authority, and one owner-notifier closure: a resume is not a read, a retired arena keeps its RC holders, an unknown grant is not a release, and a resource alias does not by itself protect the owner. Not a GSI trace, native admission, or family acceptance.",
